OL,3,CBoy, 17, stabbed to death following
OL,4,C'horrific violence' in Luton, police
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FA boy has been stabbed to death
OL,8,Ffollowing reports of "horrific
OL,9,Fviolence" where a number of teenagers
OL,10,Fwere seen carrying large knives,
OL,11,Fpolice said.
OL,13,FBedfordshire Police officers had been
OL,14,Fcalled to Kingsway Recreation Ground
OL,15,Fin Luton shortly after 6.30pm on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,18,FThe 17-year-old male was taken to
OL,19,Fhospital with multiple stab wounds but
OL,20,Fdied a short time later.
OL,26,@pD@VOUqD@IO]
