OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785023285
OL,3,CBoy, 17, stabbed to death following
OL,4,C'horrific violence' in Luton, police
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FHe has not yet been formally
OL,8,Fidentified and his family are being
OL,9,Fsupported by specially trained
OL,10,Fofficers.
OL,12,FPolice said one teenage boy has been
OL,13,Farrested on suspicion of violent
OL,14,Fdisorder in connection with the
OL,15,Fincident and is being questioned in
OL,16,Fcustody.
OL,18,FA second teenager detained for the
OL,19,Fsame offence remains in hospital with
OL,20,Fserious injuries.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
