OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785023285
OL,3,CBoy, 17, stabbed to death following
OL,4,C'horrific violence' in Luton, police
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FA murder investigation has been
OL,8,Flaunched, with detectives from the
OL,10,FBedfordshire, Cambridgeshire and
OL,11,FHertfordshire Major Crime Unit have
OL,12,Flaunched a murder investigation and
OL,13,Fappealed for witnesses and anyone with
OL,14,Finformation to come forward.
OL,16,FDetective Chief Inspector Nick
OL,17,FGardener said: "Horrific violence in
OL,18,FLuton has sadly cost a teenage boy his
OL,19,Flife today.
OL,26,@yD@POU
