OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785023285
OL,3,CBoy, 17, stabbed to death following
OL,4,C'horrific violence' in Luton, police
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,F"Our thoughts are first and foremost
OL,8,Fwith the loved ones of the boy who
OL,9,Flost his life in such tragic
OL,10,Fcircumstances.
OL,12,F"Incidents such as this have a
OL,13,Fsignificant impact on our communities.
OL,15,F"There is currently an increased
OL,16,Fpolice presence in the area, and high
OL,17,Fvisibility patrols will continue."
