OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785023285
OL,3,CBoy, 17, stabbed to death following
OL,4,C'horrific violence' in Luton, police
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,F"We are aware that images and videos
OL,8,Fare circulating on social media.
OL,9,FPlease refrain from sharing any such
OL,10,Ffootage and instead contact police.
OL,11,FNot only is this material distressing
OL,12,Ffor the family, but it could also form
OL,13,Fpart of vital evidence in our
OL,14,Finvestigation."
OL,16,FLocal Councillor Zanib Raja said
OL,17,F"Luton is hurting" and a family had
OL,18,Fbeen "shattered" in the aftermath of
OL,19,Fthe incident.
