OL,3,CBoy, 17, stabbed to death following
OL,4,C'horrific violence' in Luton, police
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,F"My deepest condolences go to his
OL,8,Floved ones. No words can ease this
OL,9,Fpain, but our community stands with
OL,10,Fyou tonight," she wrote in a post on
OL,11,FFacebook.
OL,13,FAnyone with information is urged to
OL,14,Fvisit the Bedfordshire Police website
OL,15,For call 101, quoting Operation
OL,16,FCrownbeacon.
